<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="#">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Power Management</span></div></div><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Markets we serve</div><h1 class="mk-h1">Power semiconductor module and discrete manufacturing</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures IGBT and SiC power modules, intelligent power modules and power discretes for inverters, motor drives, chargers and other power-electronics applications. Capabilities include die attach, DBC substrate assembly, heavy-current interconnect, encapsulation and reliability testing on lines supporting silicon and wide-bandgap devices.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#products" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Product examples</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-power-management-hero.webp" alt="IGBT and SiC power module assembly inside an inverter housing" style="object-position:30% center;" /></div></div><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-bottom:52px;"><div class="mk-strip"><span class="hana-spec-label" style="flex-shrink:0;">Product examples</span><div class="mk-chips"><span>IGBT power modules</span><span>SiC power modules</span><span>IPM motor-control modules</span><span>Power discretes</span><span>Dual Cool (Compact)</span><span data-om-id="ad3301a2:316">Solar inverter modules</span></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:760px;margin-bottom:34px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow on-dark">Why power management buyers choose Hana</div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Power packaging built around the thermal path</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:14px 0 0;">Power-module reliability depends on the construction of the thermal and current paths through the package. Hana manufactures IGBT and SiC modules, IPMs and power discretes using controlled die attach, substrate assembly, heavy-current interconnect and encapsulation processes, with reliability and cycling test available according to program requirements.</p></div><div class="mk-points"><div class="pt"><div class="t">Silicon and wide-bandgap</div><p>Assembly capability for silicon, SiC and GaN devices, including laser dicing processes for wide-bandgap materials.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Built for the thermal path</div><p>DBC substrates, heavy copper interconnect, high-thermal die attach and silver-sinter processes for power-module thermal and current-path requirements.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Multi-site manufacturing</div><p>Power-module and discrete manufacturing across Hana sites in Thailand and China provides additional capacity and supply-continuity options within the group.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="products" data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:28px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">Product examples</h2></div><div class="mk-cards c2"><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/power-management/igbt-sic-modules"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-power-module-family.webp" alt="IGBT and SiC power module family"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">IGBT &amp; SiC Power Modules</div><p>IGBT, SiC and intelligent power-module assembly across standard package families, including DBC substrate assembly, high-thermal die attach, heavy-current interconnect and reliability test.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/power-management/power-discrete"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-power-management-card-power-discrete.webp" alt="Packaged power discrete devices in TO-247 and TO-220 formats"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Power Discrete Assembly</div><p>Packaging of MOSFETs, SiC diodes, SiC switches and other power discretes in through-hole and surface-mount package formats for power-conversion and motor-control applications.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:720px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2><p class="mk-body">Power-module and discrete assembly runs across Hana sites in Thailand and China. Programs can be qualified across more than one site where additional manufacturing capacity or supply continuity is required. See <a href="/locations">Locations</a> for plant-level detail.</p></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ayutthaya"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div><div class="note">wide-bandgap power IPM and RF power assembly</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><div class="note">IGBT and SiC modules, power discrete and module packaging</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div></div></section><section style="background:#fff;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mk-body">Common questions from power-electronics engineering and procurement teams.</p></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does Hana build for power management?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures power semiconductor modules and discretes, including IGBT and SiC modules, IPMs for motor control, and power discretes in through-hole and surface-mount package formats.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Does Hana make finished inverters or EV chargers?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana's manufacturing scope is at power-module and discrete-device level. These packaged semiconductor products are integrated by customers into finished inverters, converters, motor drives and chargers.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana assemble SiC and GaN as well as silicon?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana supports silicon, SiC and GaN devices, with laser dicing processes available for wide-bandgap materials.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Which sites serve power management programs?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Power-module and discrete assembly runs in Thailand at Ayutthaya and in China at Jiaxing.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Start a power module build program with Hana</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what the module switches and where it runs. We will point you to the right site and processes, and come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section>